### Reports API — Full Parameter Coverage
### IntelliJ HTTP Client / VS Code REST Client
### Real distributor IDs from your DB:
###   29 = Tanvi Patel Kirana Store  (most data)
###   44 = S K Traders
###   45 = Sailendra Saha
###   39 = Koshi Bihar Enterprises
###   30 = Puja Treders
###   60 = Subodh Kumar
###   64 = Maa Janki Traders

@host         = http://localhost:8080
@fullStart    = 2026-01-01
@fullEnd      = 2026-12-31
@q1Start      = 2026-04-01
@q1End        = 2026-06-30
@q2Start      = 2026-07-01
@q2End        = 2026-07-31
@last30Start  = 2026-06-26
@last30End    = 2026-07-26
@distA        = 29
@distB        = 44
@distC        = 45


# ============================================================
# 1. MIS DASHBOARD  →  /api/reports/mis
#
# Params:
#   distributorId  — optional Long
#   startDate      — optional YYYY-MM-DD
#   endDate        — optional YYYY-MM-DD
#   financialYear  — optional String  (e.g. "2026-27")
# ============================================================

### 1.1  KPI — no filters (full picture)
GET {{host}}/api/reports/mis/kpi-summary
Accept: application/json

###

### 1.2  KPI — full date range, no distributor
GET {{host}}/api/reports/mis/kpi-summary?startDate={{fullStart}}&endDate={{fullEnd}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 1.3  KPI — Q1 only
GET {{host}}/api/reports/mis/kpi-summary?startDate={{q1Start}}&endDate={{q1End}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 1.4  KPI — scoped to Tanvi Patel (distA=29)
GET {{host}}/api/reports/mis/kpi-summary?distributorId={{distA}}&startDate={{fullStart}}&endDate={{fullEnd}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 1.5  KPI — scoped to S K Traders (distB=44)
GET {{host}}/api/reports/mis/kpi-summary?distributorId={{distB}}&startDate={{fullStart}}&endDate={{fullEnd}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 1.6  KPI — by financial year string
GET {{host}}/api/reports/mis/kpi-summary?financialYear=2026-27
Accept: application/json

###

### 1.7  Recent Invoices — no filters (last 10 globally)
GET {{host}}/api/reports/mis/recent-invoices
Accept: application/json

###

### 1.8  Recent Invoices — full year
GET {{host}}/api/reports/mis/recent-invoices?startDate={{fullStart}}&endDate={{fullEnd}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 1.9  Recent Invoices — scoped to Tanvi Patel
GET {{host}}/api/reports/mis/recent-invoices?distributorId={{distA}}&startDate={{fullStart}}&endDate={{fullEnd}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 1.10 Recent Invoices — Q2 only
GET {{host}}/api/reports/mis/recent-invoices?startDate={{q2Start}}&endDate={{q2End}}
Accept: application/json

###


