### 2.7  Low Stock — RAW only
GET {{host}}/api/reports/inventory/low-stock?category=RAW
Accept: application/json

###

### 2.8  Low Stock — SCRAP only
GET {{host}}/api/reports/inventory/low-stock?category=SCRAP
Accept: application/json

