GET {{host}}/api/reports/scrap/lifecycle
Accept: application/json

###

### 12.4 Disposal Status — full year
GET {{host}}/api/reports/scrap/disposal-status?startDate={{fullStart}}&endDate={{fullEnd}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 12.5 Disposal Status — Q1 only
GET {{host}}/api/reports/scrap/disposal-status?startDate={{q1Start}}&endDate={{q1End}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 12.6 Disposal Status — no date filter (all time)
GET {{host}}/api/reports/scrap/disposal-status
Accept: application/json

###

### 12.7 Total Approved Revenue — full year
GET {{host}}/api/reports/scrap/revenue?startDate={{fullStart}}&endDate={{fullEnd}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 12.8 Total Approved Revenue — Q1 only
GET {{host}}/api/reports/scrap/revenue?startDate={{q1Start}}&endDate={{q1End}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 12.9 Total Approved Revenue — no date filter (all time)
GET {{host}}/api/reports/scrap/revenue
Accept: application/json

